4.2 Test conditions
As shown in Table 1, three different data input conditions were tested in the user test. All three conditions used a Sony closed HMD and a pair of P5 data glove. In Condition (P), a physical keyboard was used as the data input device. In Condition (V), a virtual keyboard without haptic feedback was used. In Condition (VH), a virtual keyboard with haptic feedback was used. For each test condition, the participants were asked to change the dimension of a virtual object using the number keys and enter a string of predeﬁned characters using the character keys. After completing the task, the participants were asked to touch the virtual bar to examine the changes made by the keyboard.

