The study used two P5 data gloves as the input device. When two P5 data gloves were too close, tracking might cause errors. P5 data gloves were too cumbersome for long-time operation. In the future, more advanced tracking device can be adopted. In addition, the current study only evaluated typing short words. In the future, typing longer sentences will be investigated.
